1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.417
This video describes how to prepare the child and mother or care before performing

2
00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:11.000
the fund-red reflex tests in both newborns and older children.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.109
The child should be held securely yet comfortably either on the lap over a

4
00:00:17.109 --> 00:00:20.600
shoulder or if baby lying on their back.

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.011
It is important for them to feel safe.

6
00:00:24.011 --> 00:00:28.700
Young babies can be restless and may need to be swallowed.

7
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:35.580
Examining shortly after a feed can help as they will be relaxed and a little sleepy.

8
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.780
All our children may settle by playing with a toy for a short while.

9
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:46.540
Speak with a friendly tune and try to get down to their eyes level.

10
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:52.060
Explain what you are going to do and gain concepts before you start.

11
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:57.536
First ask the mother or care if they have not any wrong with their

12
00:00:57.536 --> 00:00:59.100
child's eye or vision

13
00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.065
and how long they have not seen the problem.

14
00:01:02.065 --> 00:01:04.700
Next look at the child's face and eyes.

15
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.300
Ask yourself some questions.

16
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:11.100
Does the child seem to have pain in one or both eyes?

17
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.300
Are the eyes

18
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.420
open or are they keeping them tightly shut?

19
00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:18.540
Is there watering or discharge from the eyes?

20
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.500
Are the eyes the same size?

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.340
Are the eyelids swollen?

22
00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.020
Now consider how the child is seeing.

23
00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:31.020
Move your face slowly from side to side, watching their eyes.

24
00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.700
Make some silent smile.

25
00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:39.860
Does the child follow the movement of your face or respond to your silent smile?

26
00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.060
Again ask yourself some questions.

27
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.940
Do both eyes move freely and together?

28
00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:51.020
The eyes straight or is one eye timing emotes or outwards.

29
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.650
Do the eyes wobble.

30
00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:59.877
You can also use the flashlight on the arclights and the pictures of the

31
00:01:59.877 --> 00:02:01.370
bed to gain attention

32
00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.570
and assess the quality of vision.

33
00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:08.210
Move the target side to side up and down.

34
00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:13.450
Look to see if the child is fixing and following the targets.

35
00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:17.770
When they reach and point accurately at the

36
00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:22.090
target, often only one eye cannot see well.

37
00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:26.830
You or mother can cover one eye, then the other.

38
00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.710
Move the target and compare how the child behaves to when using both eyes,

39
00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.970
then one at

40
00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:34.970
a time.

41
00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:40.321
If the child does not like one eye being covered, it suggests the uncovered

42
00:02:40.321 --> 00:02:41.850
eye does not see

43
00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:42.850
so well.

44
00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:49.650
If you think you can see something wrong with the external eye, look more closely using

45
00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.850
the loop end of the atlight.

46
00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:58.330
Switch the lights on and move up close to around 6 cm.

47
00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:04.370
You may need to use your finger to gently open the eyelids.

48
00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.370
Ask yourself some questions.

49
00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:12.450
Is the white part of the eye pink already?

50
00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:19.690
This pupil or cornea gray or white is the pupil round.

51
00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:23.210
Can you see any foreign bodies?

52
00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:26.570
Now you are ready to perform the reflex test.
